// Jefferson County, Ohio — curated directory of meaningful links.
// Single source of truth for the app. Keep entries verified and current.
// Fields: name, category, subcategory, url, description
// Last reviewed: 2026-11-10
//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be. The county site (jeffersoncountyoh.com) only renders with
// JavaScript, so its office pages, the real estate search and the new Clerk of
// Courts site were checked in a browser, along with the Board of Elections.
//
// THINGS THAT CHANGED SINCE JULY
//
//   * Eastern Gateway Community College closed in 2025; its Steubenville campus is
//     now YSU-Steubenville, which is listed.
//   * Trinity Health System is now UPMC Trinity (same trinityhealth.com site).
//   * The Clerk of Courts has a new site, jeffersoncountyohcoc.com.
//   * Edison Local Schools' current site is edisonwildcats.org.
//   * The City of Steubenville is listed at cityofsteubenville.us.
//   * OhioMeansJobs now points to the Community Action Council's center page.
//   * The Auditor's real estate search is the county's own (county-hosted).
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Jefferson County WV (across the river), KY, AL, CO, NY and others; Weirton,
//   Wheeling and Follansbee are West Virginia; jeffersonohio.gov is the Village of
//   Jefferson in Ashtabula County; edisonchargers.org is Edison Local in Erie County;
//   "Greater Jefferson County Foundation" is Iowa; Toronto, Canada.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * Two cities (Steubenville, the seat, and Toronto). Villages with sites:
//     Wintersville and Mingo Junction; the other villages have none found.
//   * Five school districts (Steubenville City, Toronto City, Indian Creek, Edison,
//     Buckeye Local), served by the Jefferson County ESC and the Jefferson County
//     JVS. Franciscan University and YSU-Steubenville are in Steubenville.
//   * The regional planning body is the Brooke-Hancock-Jefferson MPC, shared with
//     two West Virginia counties.
//
// LEFT OUT
//
//   * Brush Creek Wildlife Area: ODNR places it near Salineville (Columbiana).
//   * Harrison Hills and Southern Local: on the ESC's list but in other counties.
//   * Townships (except Knox), most villages and fire departments, the land bank,
//     the humane society, YMCA, Habitat and local radio: no website found.
//   * Private businesses (RV park, entertainment venue) and vendor portals.

